<title>POLAND: Polish Bank Komunalny to enter bourse September 18.</title>
<headline>Polish Bank Komunalny to enter bourse September 18.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Bank Komunalny SA w Gdyni will enter the Warsaw Stocks Exchange on September 18, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Bank Komunalny's 3.3 million shares will be listed on the main market of the bourse.</p>
<p>Earlier the bank said it wanted to enter the bourse on September 19.</p>
<p>Bank Komunalny had a 6.5 million zloty net profit last year on interest and other income of 20.8 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
